> - PID consumer number **confirmed**: 1-877-881-6388. CMS No Surprises number **unverified**: consumer sources list 1-800-MEDICARE (1-800-633-4227); check cms.gov/nosurprises before using any number in a letter.
> - Statutes of limitations table: written-contract period pinned to **42 Pa.C.S. § 5525(a)(8)**; UTPCPL period cited to **42 Pa.C.S. § 5527(b)** with "generally applied" phrasing retained (no decision specifically on UTPCPL was located).
> - § 5533(b) partial-payment/acknowledgment effect remains unverified.
> - Added a plan-type screening step (denial-notice language test) to Section 6.
