│ │
Demand Final Administrative Hold File PID External Review (Fully Insured)
& Notice of Regulatory Referral or CMS Federal Complaint (Self-Funded)
│ │
└─────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┘
▼
[ Parallel Regulatory Complaints ]
